IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. INTEREST.

DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 BALANCE PIC 9(7)V99.
01 RATE PIC 99V99.
01 INTEREST PIC 9(7)V99.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.

    DISPLAY "ENTER BALANCE:"
    ACCEPT BALANCE

    DISPLAY "ENTER ANNUAL RATE:"
    ACCEPT RATE

    COMPUTE INTEREST ROUNDED =
        BALANCE * RATE / 1200

    DISPLAY "MONTHLY INTEREST: " INTEREST

    STOP RUN.
